<title>ARGENTINA: Chile, Argentina open Andean gas pipeline.</title>
<headline>Chile, Argentina open Andean gas pipeline.</headline>
<dateline>MENDOZA, Argentina 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean and Argentine Presidents Eduardo Frei and Carlos Menem officially opened a $325 million pipeline on Thursday to pump natural gas from Argentina over the Andes to the Chilean capital, Santiago.</p>
<p>&quot;Carrying out an energy union between our countries is, without doubt, a clear and unmistakeable signal of the dynamic process of bilateral integration which both governments are promoting,&quot; Frei said in a ceremony in the city of Mendoza in central Argentina.</p>
</text>
